- **Schedule basis (A7):** **t=0 allocation** — the window's first ≈1 s is the previous episode's tail (molcajete with white dice, census CP0) and carries no T233 lifecycle; the lifecycle (source 40–46 s) is re-based to build t=0 = source 40.0 s by the single named offset **−1000 ms from segment-relative time**. The re-basing is an allocation, named here, not a silent re-base.
